    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but like… what if stopping punishing myself isn't enough? what if i genuinely just don't get better? not as a self-critical thought, more just… as a real possibility i'm sitting with\n\nbecause when i'm honest with myself, i'm running out of reasons to believe things will improve. and when i stop believing that — i don't know what i have left to hold onto",
